cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills, hooks or the agent in your work, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Orthonym Skills: Claude Code skills for measurement-driven chemistry development"
abstract: >-
  A collection of Claude Code skills, PreToolUse hooks and a reference-consult agent that
  encode a measurement-first development discipline for chemistry software and ML tools:
  prove a code site is on the execution path before editing it, validate a fix target is a
  real defect class before building, reuse existing results before re-running expensive
  measurements, bound optimisation objectives, and obtain an adversarial cross-model review
  before shipping a load-bearing claim. Hardened on a deterministic SMILES-to-IUPAC naming
  engine and generalized so the method transfers to other chemistry sub-domains.
